  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.24 Housing infrastructure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.24 “Housing infrastructure” means any infrastructure that supports housing including but not limited to new construction or capacity increases for drinking water, sanitary sewer, stormwater, highway infrastructure, telecommunications, and electrical distribution infrastructure.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
